 "Tennis", "Hockey", "sport"], "long_description": "# \u26bd Welcome To The First Ever VR Soccer Club!\nJoin the soccer craze and become part of the ultimate hangout experience with endless possibilities for you and your friends \ud83e\udd19\n\n# \u26bd Explore a Massive Soccer Park Packed With Nonstop Soccer Fun\n{636040255621029}\n# \u26bd Master The Ball With Realistic Physics And Next-Level Control\n{2218231991904189}\n# \u26bd Play 1V1 As a Team Or Team Up For 2V2 To 5V5 Matches\n{1307905307188506}\n# \u26bd Choose Your Movement Style\n{1241074994252432}\n# \u26bd Create And Customize Your Player\n{1301259194446538}\n# \u26bd Climb The Ranks And Unlock Rare Cards \n{3950362221959108}\n# \u26bd Record Your Moves And Share Your Skills With The World\n{9429449530420273}\n\n# \ud83d\udccd Zones & Features\n* \ud83c\udfc5 Main Fields - 1V1, 2v2 and 3v3 public fields\n* \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0fTraining Center - Sandbox training zone, including extra activities - Impossible Robokeeper, Soccer Dart, Target practice and Ninja obstacle course\n* \ud83d\udc5f Kick Central - Urban free-play soccer field, Tennis soccer, Teqball tables and soccer Padel court\n* \ud83c\udf34The Beachside - 2v2 Bumpy beach soccer field and Beach volleyball field\n* \ud83d\udc7eSoccer Planet - Arcade zone with multiple soccer activities - Airhockey, Basketball machines, Skeeball, Giant soccer beer pong, Pool table and more!\n* \ud83d\udca6 Wet Ball - Slippery 2v2 water soccer field!\n\n# \ud83d\udc49 Extra Features\n* Create custom private matches up to 7v7\n* Team of the Week Leaderboard \u2013 Earn an exclusive TOTW Card!\n* Goalie Mechanics - Save, dive and dominate\n\n# Time To Experience Soccer Like Never Before! \ud83c\udfc6\u26bd\n", "short_description": "\u26bd Welcome To The First Ever VR Soccer Club!\nJoin the soccer craze and become part of the ultimate hangout experience with endless possibilities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.